1
00:00:00,938 --> 00:00:03,438
(Sheldon:)What if it's banditos
shooting at us?

2
00:00:03,441 --> 00:00:04,811
(Sheldon:)What if we get kidnapped?

3
00:00:04,809 --> 00:00:07,479
(Sheldon:)What if we end up in a factory
making Bart Simpson piñatas

4
00:00:07,478 --> 00:00:09,748
for the rest of our lives?!

5
00:00:09,747 --> 00:00:11,917
It's the tire.

6
00:00:12,782 --> 00:00:13,912
(Sheldon:)Leonard?

7
00:00:13,918 --> 00:00:14,948
(Leonard:)What?

8
00:00:14,952 --> 00:00:17,522
(Sheldon:)I am getting too old
for this crud.

9
00:00:20,523 --> 00:00:23,093
(Bernadette:)Amy, I noticed
your status still says

10
00:00:23,094 --> 00:00:25,524
"in a relationship"
on Facebook.

11
00:00:25,529 --> 00:00:26,959
(Amy:)You're right.

12
00:00:26,964 --> 00:00:29,164
(Amy:)I should probably let
all of my Facebook friends know.

13
00:00:29,166 --> 00:00:32,936
(Amy:)Penny, I'm no longer
in a relationship.

14
00:00:34,471 --> 00:00:36,641
(Bernadette:)Did you change yours
to "married" yet?

15
00:00:36,640 --> 00:00:38,070
(Penny:)Uh, no, not yet.

16
00:00:38,075 --> 00:00:40,105
(Penny:)There's still a few people
I haven't told personally.

17
00:00:40,111 --> 00:00:41,181
(Amy:)Who?

18
00:00:41,178 --> 00:00:42,678
(Penny:)Oh, just my parents

19
00:00:42,680 --> 00:00:44,180
(Penny:)and my entire family.
(clears throat)

20
00:00:44,181 --> 00:00:45,951
(Leonard:)What?

21
00:00:45,950 --> 00:00:47,020
(Penny:)Why?

22
00:00:47,018 --> 00:00:48,448
(Penny:)Well, I don't want
to hurt my dad.

23
00:00:48,452 --> 00:00:49,652
(Penny:)You know, he always wanted

24
00:00:49,653 --> 00:00:51,323
(Penny:)to dance with his daughter
at her wedding.

25
00:00:51,322 --> 00:00:52,852
(Bernadette:)What about
your sister's wedding?

26
00:00:52,857 --> 00:00:55,827
(Penny:)They started to,
then her water broke.

27
00:00:56,993 --> 00:00:58,893
(Penny:)You know, if he finds out
we eloped,

28
00:00:58,896 --> 00:01:00,066
(Penny:)it's gonna break his heart.

